# Exclude the host-only Cargo config, Cargo directories, and the tracked
# checkout-target blocker. Docker stages intentionally build into their normal
# in-container /app/target instead of the host's sibling development cache.
.cargo
target
**/target
*.log
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
*.crt
